Subject: [PATCH 18/37] =?UTF-8?q?fix(skill):=20=E6=8C=89=E5=A4=8D=E6=9F=A5?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E7=BB=93=E8=AE=BA=E4=BF=AE=20filter=20=E8=A7=A6=E5=8F=91?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E5=90=8D=EF=BC=88=E7=AC=AC=E4=B8=89=E5=8F=82=EF=BC=89=E2=80=94?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=E4=BF=AE=E6=8E=89=20event.hasNature=20is=20not=20a=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?function=20=E7=AD=89=2011=20=E5=A4=84=E5=90=8C=E7=B1=BB?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E6=AD=BB=E5=88=86=E6=94=AF=EF=BC=88=E5=85=85=E8=83=BD/?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E7=A0=B4=E7=94=B2/=E6=9A=B4=E5=87=BB/=E5=A4=A7=E5=A5=B6/?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E7=BE=A4=E7=9B=BE/=E5=85=89=E5=88=83/makeDamageLock/=E6=96=B0?=
